  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sembcorp Green Infra is one of India&#x2019;s largest independent renewable power producers. Green Infra&apos;s business caters to all forms renewable energy - wind, solar, hydro, biomass and energy efficiency. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Gurgaon, India. Sembcorp Green Infra Limited was previously known as Green Infra Limited.</narrative>
  </description>
